[00:00.00]Wellerman (Sea Shanty  Karaoke Version) - Nathan Evans
[00:02.42]There once was a ship that put to sea
[00:04.72]And the name of that ship was the Billy o' Tea
[00:07.37]The winds blew hard her bow dipped down
[00:09.86]Blow my bully boys blow Huh
[00:12.38]Soon may the Wellerman come
[00:14.88]To bring us sugar and tea and rum
[00:17.46]One day when the tonguin' is done
[00:19.77]We'll take our leave and go
[00:22.46]She had not been two weeks from shore
[00:24.89]When down on her a right whale bore
[00:27.37]The captain called all hands and swore
[00:29.77]He'd take that whale in tow Hah
[00:32.38]Soon may the Wellerman come
[00:34.92]To bring us sugar and tеa and rum
[00:37.47]One day when the tonguin' is donе
[00:39.78]We'll take our leave and go
[00:42.46]Da-da-da-da-da-da
[00:44.37]Da-da-da-da-da-da-da-da-da
[00:47.50]Da-da-da-da-da-da
[00:49.39]Da-da-da-da-da-da
[00:52.33]Before the boat had hit the water
[00:54.89]The whale's tail came up and caught her
[00:57.46]All hands to the side harpooned and fought her
[01:00.03]When she dived down below Huh
[01:02.38]Soon may the Wellerman come
[01:04.92]To bring us sugar and tea and rum
[01:07.47]One day when the tonguin' is done
[01:09.70]We'll take our leave and go
[01:12.18]No line was cut no whale was freed
[01:14.82]The Captain's mind was not of greed
[01:17.40]And he belonged to the whaleman's creed
[01:19.70]She took that ship in tow Huh
[01:22.38]Soon may the Wellerman come
[01:24.88]To bring us sugar and tea and rum
[01:27.46]One day when the tonguin' is done
[01:29.74]We'll take our leave and go
