[01:39.95]Da-da-da-da-da-da
[01:42.21]For forty days or even more
[01:44.87]The line went slack then tight once more
[01:47.36]All boats were lost there were only four
[01:49.73]But still that whale did go
[01:52.38]Soon may the Wellerman come
[01:54.92]To bring us sugar and tea and rum
[01:57.46]One day when the tonguin' is done
[01:59.78]We'll take our leave and go
[02:02.24]As far as I've heard the fight's still on
[02:04.82]The line's not cut and the whale's not gone
